{"4254500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keyboard Warriors", "steam_appid": 4254500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4905980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/1f11943386133623eb59c9751a75164f.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/1f11943386133623eb59c9751a75164f.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/1f11943386133623eb59c9751a75164f.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TYPE TO ANNIHILATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Warriors is an action-fuelled typing roguelite where you fight by typing words to command a killing machine. Use your keyboard to select your targets and unleash an endless stream of gunfire as you attempt to survive the onslaught and push deeper into the wasteland. Every victory is a chance to upgrade with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/eb8469e4c1da691f60703971068907bb.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/eb8469e4c1da691f60703971068907bb.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/eb8469e4c1da691f60703971068907bb.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your mech and experiment with builds, using weapons and abilities to create unique synergies and complement your typing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch holes through tough enemies with a railgun empowered by accuracy, create a nonstop spray of gunfire and rockets by leaning in to raw speed, or use strategy to form unique combinations and devastate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/6ce451a7e5510c9a308841538828a3d0.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/6ce451a7e5510c9a308841538828a3d0.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/6ce451a7e5510c9a308841538828a3d0.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIGHTY FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets of the world are guarded by the fiercest warriors who rose to the top. The wasteland has multiple stages protected by guardians that will require more than just mashing keys. Destroy them and uncover fragments of truth in a world that was suddenly ripped apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/d79ae35d31ed889a15f286ce0f8252b8.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/d79ae35d31ed889a15f286ce0f8252b8.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/d79ae35d31ed889a15f286ce0f8252b8.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEEK THE TRUTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage scraps of information from defeated enemies, the words you type tell the story of the world that expands as you claim hard-earned victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just forget about all the problems in the world and practice your typing skills with popular and fully customisable wordsets, typing is more fun when things explode.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/1f11943386133623eb59c9751a75164f.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/1f11943386133623eb59c9751a75164f.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/1f11943386133623eb59c9751a75164f.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TYPE TO ANNIHILATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Warriors is an action-fuelled typing roguelite where you fight by typing words to command a killing machine. Use your keyboard to select your targets and unleash an endless stream of gunfire as you attempt to survive the onslaught and push deeper into the wasteland. Every victory is a chance to upgrade with powerful abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/eb8469e4c1da691f60703971068907bb.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/eb8469e4c1da691f60703971068907bb.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/eb8469e4c1da691f60703971068907bb.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR WEAPON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your mech and experiment with builds, using weapons and abilities to create unique synergies and complement your typing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch holes through tough enemies with a railgun empowered by accuracy, create a nonstop spray of gunfire and rockets by leaning in to raw speed, or use strategy to form unique combinations and devastate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/6ce451a7e5510c9a308841538828a3d0.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/6ce451a7e5510c9a308841538828a3d0.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/6ce451a7e5510c9a308841538828a3d0.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MIGHTY FOES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets of the world are guarded by the fiercest warriors who rose to the top. The wasteland has multiple stages protected by guardians that will require more than just mashing keys. Destroy them and uncover fragments of truth in a world that was suddenly ripped apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/d79ae35d31ed889a15f286ce0f8252b8.poster.avif?t=1782993585\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/d79ae35d31ed889a15f286ce0f8252b8.webm?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/extras/d79ae35d31ed889a15f286ce0f8252b8.mp4?t=1782993585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEEK THE TRUTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salvage scraps of information from defeated enemies, the words you type tell the story of the world that expands as you claim hard-earned victories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just forget about all the problems in the world and practice your typing skills with popular and fully customisable wordsets, typing is more fun when things explode.</p>", "short_description": "Use your keyboard to unleash a torrent of gunfire and destruction, cutting your way through huge hordes of enemies. Customise and upgrade your mech with new weapons and abilities, make builds that complement your loadout and typing style as you lay waste to the wasteland in a world left in ruins.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/343214d3d660abf02bf7369ea5cd4bd80744c335/header.jpg?t=1782993585", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/409a4a19182b8aaae73275ae473a1b938f193283/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782993585", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254500/409a4a19182b8aaae73275ae473a1b938f193283/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782993585", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 260